'''Find Hanns Krieghor, a rogue guildmaster:'''

You say, 'Carson has a mole in the Highpass guards.'

Hanns Krieghor says 'Arrgg, that Carson can't control anything. Sometimes he's practically useless. Go tell Zannsin that [I want him to send some of his men to Prak in Highpass], to help Carson get back on track.'

'''Listening to the conversation between Hans and Zannsin reveals that the spy is working for the bandit leader in the Karanas named Rujahn Tahslek.'''

Say to Zannsin Resdinet, 'Hanns wants you to send some of your men to Prak in Highpass.' 

: Zannsin Resdinet says 'Hmm, I see. Maybe you can help us out with this, huh? I think it'd be a perfect opportunity for you to prove just how valuable you are to our little organization. Take this letter to Prak at Golden Rooster in Highpass, and see what you can do to help him out.' 

'''Upon handing the note in to Prak, he asks you to kill Guard Stald and return with his badge as proof of his death. He mentions that you will receive a "Cloak of the Unseen Hands". '''

'''Guard Stald spawns at either the front gate, beside the Tiger's Roar, or beside Top of the World. He is about level 15 or so. When you bring him the badge, he gives you a note to return back to Qeynos'''

Returning the note results in a {{:Black Leather Cloak}}.

